Components.Report=()=>"<div data-node-id=\"344:26526\" style=\"align-content:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start;position:relative;width:100%;height:100%\"><p data-node-id=\"344:26527\" style=\"overflow-wrap:break-word;font-family:Arial,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;line-height:22px;min-width:100%;font-style:normal;position:relative;flex-shrink:0;color:#bfbfbf;font-size:14px;width:min-content\">资金面：优先分析主力资金流向（净流入/净流出）、量能变化（放量/缩量）、资金异动节点（早盘/尾盘/盘中），核心判断“资金是否有持续进攻/出逃意愿”，是短期行情的核心驱动；</p><div data-node-id=\"344:26528\" data-name=\"image 112\" style=\"aspect-ratio:659/250;border-width:1px;border-color:#383838;border-style:solid;position:relative;border-radius:8px;flex-shrink:0;width:100%\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets/f4584.png\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0px;max-width:none;object-position:bottom;pointer-events:none;border-radius:8px;width:100%;height:100%\"></div><p data-node-id=\"344:26529\" style=\"overflow-wrap:break-word;font-family:Arial,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;line-height:22px;min-width:100%;font-style:normal;position:relative;flex-shrink:0;color:#bfbfbf;font-size:14px;width:min-content\">技术面：聚焦K线形态、均线排列、关键指标（MACD/KDJ/RSI）、支撑压力位，核心判断“技术形态是否健康，是否突破/跌破关键位置”，给出短期走势信号；</p><div data-node-id=\"344:26530\" style=\"grid-template-columns:max-content;grid-template-rows:max-content;display:inline-grid;line-height:0;place-items:start;position:relative;flex-shrink:0\"><div data-node-id=\"344:26531\" data-name=\"image 113\" style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:#383838;border-style:solid;grid-column:1;height:289px;margin-left:0px;margin-top:0px;position:relative;border-radius:8px;grid-row:1;width:649px\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0px;overflow:hidden;pointer-events:none;border-radius:8px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets/3419e.png\" style=\"position:absolute;height:97.92%;left:-0.06%;max-width:none;top:0px;width:100.13%\"></div></div><div data-node-id=\"344:26532\" style=\"background-color:#22272e;grid-column:1;margin-left:636px;margin-top:142px;position:relative;grid-row:1;width:9px;height:9px\"></div><div data-node-id=\"344:26533\" style=\"background-color:#22272e;grid-column:1;margin-left:636px;margin-top:2px;position:relative;grid-row:1;width:9px;height:9px\"></div><div data-node-id=\"344:26534\" style=\"background-color:#22272e;grid-column:1;margin-left:2px;margin-top:4px;position:relative;grid-row:1;width:6px;height:6px\"></div><div data-node-id=\"344:26535\" style=\"background-color:#22272e;grid-column:1;margin-left:2px;margin-top:143px;position:relative;grid-row:1;width:6px;height:6px\"></div></div><p data-node-id=\"344:26536\" style=\"overflow-wrap:break-word;font-family:Arial,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif;line-height:22px;min-width:100%;font-style:normal;position:relative;flex-shrink:0;color:#bfbfbf;font-size:14px;width:min-content\">基本面：简要更新行业景气度、公司核心逻辑（业绩、题材、竞争力），排查潜在风险（业绩暴雷、减持、监管问询等），避免踩雷；</p><div data-node-id=\"344:26537\" data-name=\"image 115\" style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:#383838;border-style:solid;height:141px;position:relative;border-radius:8px;flex-shrink:0;width:662px\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0px;overflow:hidden;pointer-events:none;border-radius:8px\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets/b92ec.png\" style=\"position:absolute;height:229.81%;left:-1.4%;max-width:none;top:-36.23%;width:102.8%\"></div></div></div>";

